     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* CLAIMPF -- Insurance claim physical file
     A* Library: ESH101
     A*
     A* POLID is borrowed from POLICYPF via REFFLD — documents the FK
     A* relationship and ensures field attributes stay in sync.
     A*
     A* CLAIMSTS values: O=Open  A=Approved  R=Rejected  P=Paid
     A* CLAIMTYPE values: COLL LIAB FIRE DISA HOSP DRUG WIND
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R CLAIMREC
     A*                                     -- Identifiers
     A            CLAIMNO        8S 0       COLHDG('CLAIM' 'NO')
     A            POLID                     REFFLD(POLID POLICYPF)
     A*                                     -- Claim details
     A            CLAIMDT         L         COLHDG('CLAIM' 'DATE')
     A                                      DATFMT(*ISO)
     A            CLAIMTYPE      4A         COLHDG('TYPE')
     A            AMOUNT        11P 2       COLHDG('AMOUNT')
     A            CLAIMSTS       1A         COLHDG('STATUS')
     A            DESCR         50A         COLHDG('DESCRIPTION')
     A          K CLAIMNO
